        <mxCell id="boundary" value="&lt;div style=&quot;white-space:normal;line-height:1.25;&quot;&gt;Adjacent processes use dashed borders and retain their level 0 numbers; they are not new external entities.&lt;br&gt;Answer selection and countdown run in the access application; there is no invented per-answer Hub route.&lt;br&gt;Offline completion is QUEUED_FOR_SYNC until delivered. Validation: submitted_at - started_at &amp;lt;= duration + 60 s.&lt;br&gt;Client chat is unmounted during an active attempt; the Hub independently enforces the AI rejection.&lt;br&gt;Remote countdown uses the fetched Hub anchor. Timing-anchor precedence is an ASK LEAD item in the section text.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1" kind="note">
